      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "### CulturePick / Nginx\nLoki access/error logs + Prometheus Node Exporter. **Log host** filters logs. **Node Exporter host** must be set to the Nginx server IP; these selectors are independent.\n\nCounts use the selected time range. Log timestamps reflect Alloy ingestion time. Empty access logs show **No data**. Zero errors means no matching collected records; it does not independently verify log collection health. Request latency and active Nginx connections are unavailable with current inputs.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "NGINX | Traffic, logs & server health",
      "type": "text"
    },
